{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "NONOTOWN: Nonogram Logic Puzzle",
    "steam_appid": 2240720,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240720/extras/beef244a29a00755ad9d8fdd2bc33951.poster.avif?t=1742261088\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240720/extras/beef244a29a00755ad9d8fdd2bc33951.webm?t=1742261088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240720/extras/beef244a29a00755ad9d8fdd2bc33951.mp4?t=1742261088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NONOTOWN takes the classic puzzle-solving experience of nonograms to a whole new level with four distinct game modes. Whether you're a fan of traditional puzzles or looking for something more dynamic, NONOTOWN has something for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>Classic</strong> and <strong>Color</strong> modes, you'll use logic and precision to fill in grids based on the numerical clues provided. But the real twist comes with our innovative <strong>Blocks</strong> and <strong>Color Blocks</strong> modes. Here, you'll encounter pre-filled segments that need to be rotated to fit into place, creating a <strong>fresh and challenging</strong> layer of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240720/extras/0ab4ed8f88b90693c89cc136dba5588f.poster.avif?t=1742261088\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240720/extras/0ab4ed8f88b90693c89cc136dba5588f.webm?t=1742261088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240720/extras/0ab4ed8f88b90693c89cc136dba5588f.mp4?t=1742261088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>over 300 levels</strong> spread across all modes, NONOTOWN offers endless hours of puzzle-solving fun. Each mode has its own unique strategies, keeping the game exciting and rewarding for both newcomers and nonogram veterans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock achievements, challenge your brain, and enjoy a visually rich puzzle experience that keeps you coming back for more. Ready to master the art of nonograms and tackle the blocks? NONOTOWN is waiting for you!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240720/extras/beef244a29a00755ad9d8fdd2bc33951.poster.avif?t=1742261088\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240720/extras/beef244a29a00755ad9d8fdd2bc33951.webm?t=1742261088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240720/extras/beef244a29a00755ad9d8fdd2bc33951.mp4?t=1742261088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NONOTOWN takes the classic puzzle-solving experience of nonograms to a whole new level with four distinct game modes. Whether you're a fan of traditional puzzles or looking for something more dynamic, NONOTOWN has something for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>Classic</strong> and <strong>Color</strong> modes, you'll use logic and precision to fill in grids based on the numerical clues provided. But the real twist comes with our innovative <strong>Blocks</strong> and <strong>Color Blocks</strong> modes. Here, you'll encounter pre-filled segments that need to be rotated to fit into place, creating a <strong>fresh and challenging</strong> layer of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240720/extras/0ab4ed8f88b90693c89cc136dba5588f.poster.avif?t=1742261088\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240720/extras/0ab4ed8f88b90693c89cc136dba5588f.webm?t=1742261088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2240720/extras/0ab4ed8f88b90693c89cc136dba5588f.mp4?t=1742261088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>over 300 levels</strong> spread across all modes, NONOTOWN offers endless hours of puzzle-solving fun. Each mode has its own unique strategies, keeping the game exciting and rewarding for both newcomers and nonogram veterans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock achievements, challenge your brain, and enjoy a visually rich puzzle experience that keeps you coming back for more. Ready to master the art of nonograms and tackle the blocks? NONOTOWN is waiting for you!</p>",
    "short_description": "NONOTOWN is a puzzle game with four nonogram modes: classic, color, and two unique challenges\u2014'Block' and 'Color Block,' where pre-filled parts must be rotated to solve. Put your logic to the test with hundreds of levels across all modes!",
